    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**How to read this.** PSI compares the last 60 trading days of each stock's daily returns with the year before (above 0.25 = significant). When at least 30% of stocks drift, or the live forecast error is 1.25x worse than the naive forecast, an alert calls the scheduler, which retrains the LSTM; the promotion gate then keeps or replaces the production model. Thresholds: `params.yaml` \u2192 `monitoring`."
      }
    },
